        <p source="#source-84359-84448"><seg source="#source-84359-84410">丙（ポトパン）と丁（アントニー）と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84410-84422"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84422-84425">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84425-84440"><rb>來</rb><rt>きた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84440-84448">る。</seg></p>
