        <p source="#source-84816-85175"><seg source="#source-84816-84834">丁　　　さう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84834-84870"><rb>彼方此方</rb><rt>あッちこッち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84870-84873">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84873-84885"><rb>居</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84885-84897">ることは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84897-84915"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84915-84954">んわ。（一同に對ひ）ささ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84954-84972"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84972-84978">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-84978-84996"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-84996-85005">いた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85005-85032"><rb>暫時</rb><rt>ちっとのま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85032-85041">ぢゃ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85041-85059"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85059-85065">いた</seg><choice source="#source-85065-85071"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-85071-85086">。さうして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85086-85110"><rb>長生</rb><rt>ながいき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85110-85119">すりゃ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85119-85164"><rb>持丸長者</rb><rt>もちまるちゃうじゃ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85164-85175">ぢゃ。</seg></p>
