        <p source="#source-85275-85757"><seg source="#source-85275-85296">カピューレット</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85296-85323"><rb>長者</rb><rt>ちゃうじゃ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85323-85326">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85326-85341"><rb>先</rb><rt>さき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85341-85365">に、ヂュリエット</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85365-85380"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85380-85383">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85383-85407"><rb>同族</rb><rt>どうぞく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85407-85410">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85410-85425"><rb>者</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85425-85449"><rb>多勢</rb><rt>おほぜい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85449-85452">一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85452-85470"><rb>方</rb><rt>ぱう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85470-85476">より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85476-85488"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85488-85494">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85494-85515"><rb>他方</rb><rt>たはう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85515-85521">より</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85521-85533"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85533-85536">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85536-85551"><rb>來</rb><rt>きた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85551-85554">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85554-85581"><rb>賓客</rb><rt>ひんきゃく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85581-85584">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85584-85608"><rb>男女</rb><rt>なんにょ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85608-85623"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85623-85662">びロミオ、マーキューシオー</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85662-85674"><rb>等</rb><rt>ら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85674-85704"><rb>假裝者</rb><rt>かさうしゃ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85704-85710">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85710-85728"><rb>群</rb><rt>ぐん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85728-85731">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-85731-85746"><rb>迎</rb><rt>むか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-85746-85757">ふる。</seg></p>
