        <p source="#source-100320-100433"><seg source="#source-100320-100332">乳母　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-100332-100347"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-100347-100359">さま、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-100359-100374"><rb>母</rb><rt>かゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-100374-100386">さまがお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-100386-100404"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-100404-100433">がありますといな。</seg></p>
