      <div type="layout" source="#source-101386-101723" style="padding-inline-start: 4em; text-indent: -4em">
        <p source="#source-101454-101723"><seg source="#source-101454-101496">ロミオ　ではカピューレットの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101496-101514"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101514-101532">か？　おゝ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101532-101550"><rb>怖</rb><rt>おそろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101550-101556">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101556-101592"><rb>勘定狂</rb><rt>かんぢゃうくる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101592-101604">はせ！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101604-101619"><rb>俺</rb><rt>おれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101619-101622">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101622-101640"><rb>命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101640-101658">はこりゃもう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101658-101676"><rb>敵</rb><rt>かたき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101676-101685">からの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101685-101709"><rb>借物</rb><rt>かりもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101709-101723">ぢゃわ。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-101723-101877" style="padding-inline-start: 8em">
        <p source="#source-101758-101877"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101758-101782"><rb>此時</rb><rt>このとき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101782-101791">、ベン</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-7-85" source="#source-101791-101836">ヺ</g><seg source="#source-101836-101848">ーリオー</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-101848-101869"><rb>近寄</rb><rt>ちかよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-101869-101877">りて</seg></p>
