        <p source="#source-103691-103798"><seg source="#source-103691-103703">ヂュリ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103703-103721"><rb>乳母</rb><rt>うば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103721-103733">、こゝへ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103733-103745"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103745-103760">や。あのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103760-103775"><rb>方</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103775-103778">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103778-103790"><rb>誰</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103790-103798">れ？</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-103798-103887"><seg source="#source-103798-103840">乳母　　タイビリオーさまのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-103840-103864"><rb>嗣子</rb><rt>あとゝり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-103864-103887">でござります。</seg></p>
