        <p source="#source-170498-171448"><seg source="#source-170498-170531">乳母　　おのれ、わしの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170531-170546"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170546-170549">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170549-170564"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170564-170573">とでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170573-170585"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170585-170591">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170591-170603"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170603-170612">をれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170612-170624"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170624-170627">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170627-170642"><rb>物</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170642-170645">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170645-170657"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170657-170684">せうぞい。よしんば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170684-170696"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170696-170708">かけより</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170708-170723"><rb>強</rb><rt>つよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170723-170747">からうと、あんな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170747-170762"><rb>奴</rb><rt>やつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170762-170771">がまだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170771-170786"><rb>別</rb><rt>べつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170786-170795">に二十</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170795-170813"><rb>人</rb><rt>にん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170813-170828">あらうと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170828-170849"><rb>大事</rb><rt>だいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-170849-170858">ない。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-170858-170879"><rb>自力</rb><rt>じりき</rt></rub