        <p source="#source-173231-173461"><seg source="#source-173231-173246">ロミオ　お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173246-173264"><rb>乳母</rb><rt>うば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173264-173288">どの、おぬしのお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173288-173303"><rb>姫</rb><rt>ひい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173303-173312">さんへ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173312-173336"><rb>慇懃</rb><rt>ねんごろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173336-173339">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173339-173354"><rb>傳</rb><rt>つた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173354-173360">へて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173360-173375"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173375-173384">され。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173384-173399"><rb>予</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173399-173402">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173402-173426"><rb>飽迄</rb><rt>あくまで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173426-173429">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-173429-173441"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-173441-173461">うておく……</seg></p>
