<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174382-174406"><rb>婚禮</rb><rt>こんれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174406-174412">する</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174412-174430"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174430-174451">なれば。こりゃ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-174451-174484"><rb>骨折賃</rb><rt>ほねをりちん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-174484-174495">ぢゃ。</seg></p>
