        <p source="#source-265489-266295"><seg source="#source-265489-265513">カピ長　かやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265513-265537"><rb>珍變</rb><rt>ちんぺん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265537-265540">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265540-265555"><rb>起</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265555-265576">ったによって、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265576-265594"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265594-265597">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265597-265609"><rb>説</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265609-265612">き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265612-265627"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265627-265630">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265630-265648"><rb>暇</rb><rt>いとま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265648-265672">もござらなんだ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265672-265690"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265690-265711">もチッバルトを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265711-265726"><rb>甚</rb><rt>きつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265726-265729">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265729-265747"><rb>懷</rb><rt>なつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265747-265753">しう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265753-265768"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265768-265795">うてをったに、また</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265795-265816"><rb>吾等</rb><rt>われら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265816-265825">とても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265825-265849"><rb>同樣</rb><rt>どうやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265849-265876">ぢゃに。さりながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265876-265891"><rb>人</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-265891-265894">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-265894-265909"><rb>皆</rb><r