        <p source="#source-266295-266585"><seg source="#source-266295-266319">パリス　かういふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266319-266340"><rb>愁傷</rb><rt>なげき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266340-266343">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266343-266364"><rb>最中</rb><rt>さなか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266364-266370">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266370-266394"><rb>祝言</rb><rt>しうげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266394-266397">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266397-266415"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266415-266418">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266418-266436"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266436-266448">まい。お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266448-266463"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266463-266499">かた、おさらばでござる。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266499-266523"><rb>娘御</rb><rt>むすめご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266523-266538">によろしう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266538-266553"><rb>傳</rb><rt>つた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266553-266559">へて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266559-266574"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266574-266585">され。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-266585-266875"><seg source="#source-266585-266597">カピ妻　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266597-266621"><rb>心得</rb><rt>こゝろえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266621-266633">ました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266633-266651"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266651-266654">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266654-266672"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266672-266675">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266675-266693"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あす</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266693-266708"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266708-266711">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266711-266726"><rb>質</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266726-266741">しましょ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266741-266762"><rb>今宵</rb><rt>こよひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266762-266765">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266765-266786"><rb>悲嘆</rb><rt>なげき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266786-266789">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266789-266804"><rb>囚</rb><rt>とら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266804-266816">はれて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266816-266837"><rb>閉籠</rb><rt>とぢこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266837-266849">めてのみ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-266849-266861"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-266861-266875">まする。</seg></p>
