        <p source="#source-270868-271683"><seg source="#source-270868-270886">ロミオ　いや</seg><choice source="#source-270886-270892"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-270892-270895">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-270895-270910"><rb>旦</rb><rt>あさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-270910-270913">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-270913-270925"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-270925-270934">らする</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-270934-270955"><rb>雲雀</rb><rt>ひばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-270955-270988">ぢゃ、ナイチンゲールの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-270988-271003"><rb>聲</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271003-271018">ではない。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271018-271042"><rb>戀人</rb><rt>こひびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271042-271060">よ、あれ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271060-271072"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271072-271081">やれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271081-271099"><rb>意地</rb><rt>いぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271099-271102">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271102-271117"><rb>惡</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271117-271120">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271120-271144"><rb>横縞</rb><rt>よこじま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271144-271150">めが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271150-271168"><rb>東</rb><rt>ひがし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271168-271171">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271171-271186"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271186-271189">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271189-271204"><rb>雲</rb><rt>くも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271204-271207">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271207-271228"><rb>裂目</rb><rt>さけめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source