        <p source="#source-271683-272237"><seg source="#source-271683-271701">ヂュリ　あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271701-271722"><rb>光明</rb><rt>ひかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271722-271725">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271725-271740"><rb>朝</rb><rt>あさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271740-271761">ぢゃない、いえ</seg><choice source="#source-271761-271767"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-271767-271770">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271770-271791"><rb>朝日</rb><rt>あさひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271791-271824">ではないわいの。ありゃ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271824-271848"><rb>太陽</rb><rt>たいやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271848-271854">がお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271854-271869"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271869-271872">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271872-271887"><rb>爲</rb><rt>ため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271887-271893">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271893-271914"><rb>今宵</rb><rt>こよひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271914-271935">マンチュアへの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271935-271965"><rb>道案内</rb><rt>みちしるべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-271965-271968">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-271968-272001"><rb>炬火持</rb><rt>たいまつもち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-272001-272004">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-272004-272019"><rb>役</rb><rt>やく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-272019-272037">さしょとて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-272037-272052"><rb>急</rb><rt>きふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-272052-272055">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-272055-272076"><rb>呼出</rb><rt>よびだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-272076-272082">した</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-272082-272097"><rb>光</rb><rt>ひか</rt></ruby><s