        <p source="#source-283787-284200"><seg source="#source-283787-283808">カピ妻　はて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283808-283826"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283826-283832">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283832-283847"><rb>次</rb><rt>つぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283847-283850">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283850-283880"><rb>木曜日</rb><rt>もくえうび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283880-283883">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283883-283898"><rb>朝</rb><rt>あさ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283898-283913"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283913-283925">う、あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283925-283946"><rb>風流</rb><rt>みやび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283946-283952">な、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283952-283973"><rb>立派</rb><rt>りっぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-283973-283976">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-283976-284000"><rb>若殿</rb><rt>わかとの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284000-284051">のパリスどのが、セント・ピーターの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284051-284078"><rb>會堂</rb><rt>くわいだう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284078-284096">で、めでたう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284096-284117"><rb>其方</rb><rt>そなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284117-284120">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284120-284150"><rb>花嫁御</rb><rt>はなよめご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284150-284156">にお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284156-284168"><rb>爲</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284168-284174">やる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284174-284189"><rb>筈</rb><rt>はず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284189-284200">ぢゃ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-284200-285018"><seg source="#source-284200-284245">ヂュリ　そのセント・ピーターの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284245-284272"><rb>會堂</rb><rt>くわいだう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284272-284284"><rb>懸</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284284-284329">けて、いゝや、ピーターどのをも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284329-284350"><rb>誓言</rb><rt>ちかひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284350-284365">にかけて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284365-284380"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284380-284416">のそれがめでたからう！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284416-284440"><rb>嫁入</rb><rt>よめいり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284440-284461">はせぬわいの。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284461-284476"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284476-284485">といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284485-284509"><rb>早急</rb><rt>さっきふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284509-284518">ぢゃ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284518-284545"><rb>申入</rb><rt>まうしいれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284545-284548">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284548-284560"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284560-284575">かぬうちに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284575-284599"><rb>婚禮</rb><rt>こんれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284599-284605">とは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284605-284629"><rb>何事</rb><rt>なにごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284629-284641">ぢゃ？　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284641-284656"><rb>父</rb><rt>とゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284656-284665">さまに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284665-284677"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-284677-284683">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-284683-284698"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby>