        <p source="#source-285018-285296"><seg source="#source-285018-285039">カピ妻　あれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285039-285060"><rb>父御</rb><rt>ちゝご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285060-285075">がわせた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285075-285096"><rb>自身</rb><rt>じしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285096-285099">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285099-285111"><rb>然</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285111-285114">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285114-285126"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285126-285135">うて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285135-285156"><rb>父御</rb><rt>ちゝご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285156-285168">がそれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285168-285189"><rb>其方</rb><rt>そなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285189-285195">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285195-285207"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285207-285216">いて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285216-285231"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285231-285234">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285234-285249"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285249-285267">はしゃるかを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-285267-285279"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-285279-285296">たがよい。</seg></p>
