        <p source="#source-287228-287806"><seg source="#source-287228-287246">カピ長　ま、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287246-287258"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287258-287276">たしませ！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287276-287294"><rb>如何</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287294-287303">したと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287303-287315"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287315-287357">はします、いさや、どうしたと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287357-287378"><rb>被言</rb><rt>おしゃ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287378-287405">るのぢゃ？　え！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287405-287420"><rb>望</rb><rt>のぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287420-287432">まぬ？　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287432-287456"><rb>有難</rb><rt>ありがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287456-287465">いとは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287465-287480"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287480-287495">はぬか？　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287495-287510"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287510-287522"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287522-287525">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287525-287546"><rb>名譽</rb><rt>めいよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287546-287555">ぢゃと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287555-287570"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287570-287597">はぬか？　おのれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287597-287612"><rb>嬉</rb><rt>うれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287612-287624">しいとも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287624-287639"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-287639-287675">ひをらぬか、あのやうな、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-287675-287714"><rb>分不相應</rb><rt>ぶんふさうおう</rt></ruby><seg