        <p source="#source-296931-298403"><seg source="#source-296931-296943">乳母　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-296943-296967"><rb>誓文</rb><rt>せいもん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-296967-297006">、ござります。ロミオどのは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297006-297030"><rb>追放</rb><rt>つゐはう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297030-297033">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297033-297045"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297045-297063">ぢゃほどに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297063-297084"><rb>世界</rb><rt>せかい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297084-297087">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297087-297102"><rb>崩</rb><rt>くづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297102-297114">れうと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297114-297129"><rb>戻</rb><rt>もど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297129-297135">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297135-297147"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297147-297150">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297150-297165"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297165-297177">のかのと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297177-297189"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297189-297207">はッしゃらう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297207-297222"><rb>筈</rb><rt>はず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297222-297225">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297225-297237"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297237-297252">い。よしや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297252-297267"><rb>戻</rb><rt>もど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297267-297303">らッしゃるにせい、ほんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297303-297327"><rb>窃々</rb><rt>こつそり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-297327-297330">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-297330-297366"><rb>内密沙汰</rb><