        <p source="#source-319122-319679"><seg source="#source-319122-319134">ヂュリ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319134-319149"><rb>父</rb><rt>とゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319149-319158">さまの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319158-319185"><rb>命令</rb><rt>おほせごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319185-319188">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319188-319203"><rb>省</rb><rt>そむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319203-319209">いた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319209-319230"><rb>不孝</rb><rt>ふかう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319230-319233">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319233-319248"><rb>罪</rb><rt>つみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319248-319251">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319251-319266"><rb>悔</rb><rt>くや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319266-319278">むことを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319278-319293"><rb>習</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319293-319299">うた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319299-319317"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319317-319356">に。（膝まづきて）かうして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319356-319368"><rb>地</rb><rt>ち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319368-319371">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319371-319392"><rb>平伏</rb><rt>ひれふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319392-319398">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319398-319413"><rb>父</rb><rt>とゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319413-319422">さまの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319422-319440"><rb>赦</rb><rt>ゆるし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319440-319443">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319443-319455"><rb>乞</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-319455-319494">へいと、あのロレンスどのが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-319494-319506"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></r