        <p source="#source-339779-339940"><seg source="#source-339779-339800">カピ妻　あら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339800-339815"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339815-339824">しや、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339824-339842"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339842-339845">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339845-339857"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339857-339872">にました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339872-339884"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339884-339899">にました、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-339899-339911"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-339911-339940">にましたわいなう！</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-339940-340566"><seg source="#source-339940-340000">カピ長　やッ！　どれ、どこに。……やれ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340000-340015"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340015-340036">しや！　こりゃ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340036-340054"><rb>冷</rb><rt>つめた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340054-340063">いわ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340063-340075"><rb>血</rb><rt>ち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340075-340078">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340078-340093"><rb>沈</rb><rt>しず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340093-340102">んで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340102-340126"><rb>節々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-340111-340117">ふし</seg><choice source="#source-340117-340123"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340126-340129">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340129-340156"><rb>固硬</rb><rt>しゃちこば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340156-340174">って、こりゃ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340174-340189"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340189-340210"><rb>唇</rb><rt>くちびる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340210-340216">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340216-340231"><rb>息</rb><rt>いき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340231-340234">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340234-340249"><rb>離</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340249-340261">れてから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340261-340279"><rb>最早</rb><rt>もう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340279-340294"><rb>久</rb><rt>ひさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340294-340303">しい。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340303-340318"><rb>廣</rb><rt>ひろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340318-340321">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340321-340339"><rb>野邊</rb><rt>のべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340339-340345">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340345-340360"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340360-340363">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340363-340375"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340375-340378">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340378-340393"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340393-340408"><rb>花</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340408-340414">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340414-340429"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340429-340438">ならぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340438-340453"><rb>霜</rb><rt>しも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340453-340456">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340456-340468"><rb>降</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340468-340489">りたがやうに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340489-340501"><rb>死</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340501-340507">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340507-340519"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340519-340522">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-340522-340540"><rb>女</rb><rt>むすめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-340540-340566">、ヂュリエット！</seg></p>
