urce="#source-351916-351931"><rb>地</rb><rt>つち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351931-351934">ん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-351934-351949"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-351949-351952">へ</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-351952-351988" corresp="#source-351958-351988"><seg source="#source-351952-351958">めり</seg></hi><seg source="#source-351988-352009">こますぞよ、は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352009-352027"><rb>如何</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352027-352035">だ？</seg></p>
