        <p source="#source-352480-352824"><seg source="#source-352480-352492">ピータ　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352492-352507"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352507-352516">ぢゃ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352516-352531"><rb>劍</rb><rt>けん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352531-352534">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352534-352549"><rb>藏</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352549-352555">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352555-352576"><rb>洒落</rb><rt>しゃれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352576-352579">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352579-352591"><rb>拔</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352591-352624">け？　よし！　すれば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352624-352648"><rb>名劍</rb><rt>めいけん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352648-352651">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352651-352666"><rb>藏</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352666-352672">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352672-352702"><rb>名洒落</rb><rt>めいじゃれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352702-352705">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352705-352729"><rb>打挫</rb><rt>うちひし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352729-352753">いでくれう。さ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352753-352771"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352771-352780">らしう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352780-352798"><rb>試合</rb><rt>しあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352798-352804">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-352804-352816"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-352816-352824">い。</seg></p>
