        <p source="#source-368138-368287"><seg source="#source-368138-368159">ロレ　　すれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368159-368174"><rb>誰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368174-368177">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368177-368189"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368189-368195">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368195-368207"><rb>往</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368207-368234">んだぞ、ロミオへの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368234-368249"><rb>予</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368249-368252">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368252-368279"><rb>書状</rb><rt>しょじゃう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368279-368287">は？</seg></p>
