/rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368692-368718">へなんだわいの。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-368718-369365"><seg source="#source-368718-368748">ロレ　　はれ、それは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368748-368769"><rb>物怪</rb><rt>もっけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368769-368772">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368772-368793"><rb>不運</rb><rt>ふうん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368793-368802">の！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368802-368826"><rb>眞實</rb><rt>しんじつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368826-368829">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368829-368856"><rb>重大</rb><rt>ぢゅうだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368856-368859">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368859-368880"><rb>容易</rb><rt>ようゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368880-368889">ならぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368889-368913"><rb>用向</rb><rt>ようむき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368913-368916">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368916-368931"><rb>其</rb><rt>その</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368931-368955"><rb>書面</rb><rt>しょめん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368955-368967">、それが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-368967-368991"><rb>等閑</rb><rt>なほざり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-368991-369003">になった</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369003-369018"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369018-369042">は、どのやうな一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369042-369066"><rb>大事</rb><rt>だいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369066-369069">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369069-369087"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369087-369093">うも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369093-369105"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369105-369114">れぬ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369114-369135"><rb>御坊</rb><rt>ごばう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369135-369141">よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369141-369156"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369156-369159">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369159-369171"><rb>往</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369171-369177">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369177-369195"><rb>何處</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369195-369204">ぞで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369204-369228"><rb>鐵梃</rb><rt>かなてこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369228-369231">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369231-369255"><rb>才覺</rb><rt>さいかく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369255-369264">して、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369264-369279"><rb>急</rb><rt>いそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369279-369285">いで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369285-369303"><rb>此處</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369303-369306">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369306-369318"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369318-369324">って</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369324-369336"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369336-369339">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-369339-369354"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-369354-369365">され。</seg></p>
