        <p source="#source-378623-379867"><seg source="#source-378623-378650">ロミオ　いかにも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378650-378662"><rb>生</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378662-378680">きてをられぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378680-378692"><rb>身</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378692-378716">ぢゃ。なればこそ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378716-378734"><rb>此墓</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378734-378740">へは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378740-378752"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378752-378773">た。いやなう、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378773-378788"><rb>若</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378788-378791">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378791-378815"><rb>命知</rb><rt>いのちし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378815-378824">らずの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378824-378839"><rb>者</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378839-378842">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378842-378860"><rb>手出</rb><rt>てだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378860-378881">しをなさるな。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378881-378896"><rb>早</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378896-378902">うお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378902-378914"><rb>迯</rb><rt>に</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378914-378929">げなされ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378929-378944"><rb>此</rb><rt>この</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378944-378977"><rb>亡者達</rb><rt>もうじゃたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378977-378980">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378980-378995"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-378995-378998">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-378998-379013"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379013-379019">うて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379019-379034"><rb>怖</rb><rt>おそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379034-379052">れたがよい。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379052-379067"><rb>予</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379067-379070">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379070-379091"><rb>腹立</rb><rt>はらだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379091-379103">たせて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379103-379118"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379118-379121">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379121-379145"><rb>罪惡</rb><rt>ざいあく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379145-379148">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379148-379163"><rb>犯</rb><rt>をか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379163-379172">させて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379172-379187"><rb>下</rb><rt>くだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379187-379208">さるな。おゝ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379208-379223"><rb>速</rb><rt>はや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379223-379226">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379226-379238"><rb>去</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379238-379253">なしゃれ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379253-379277"><rb>眞實</rb><rt>しんじつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379277-379280">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379280-379295"><rb>予</rb><rt>わし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379295-379298">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379298-379319"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379319-379328">よりも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379328-379349"><rb>足下</rb><rt>おぬし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379349-379352">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-379352-379370"><rb>可愛</rb><rt>いと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-379370-379376">しう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sour