seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394067-394079"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394079-394103">たら、それこそは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394103-394118"><rb>假</rb><rt>かり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394118-394121">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394121-394139"><rb>命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394139-394145">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394145-394163"><rb>實</rb><rt>まこと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394163-394166">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394166-394184"><rb>命</rb><rt>いのち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394184-394187">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394187-394202"><rb>囘</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394202-394211">らする</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394211-394244"><rb>大妙藥</rb><rt>だいめうやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394244-394259">！……まだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394259-394274"><rb>温</rb><rt>ぬく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394274-394283">い、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394283-394298"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394298-394301">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-394301-394322"><rb>脣</rb><rt>くちびる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-394322-394327">！</seg></p>
