        <p source="#source-414088-414144"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-414088-414112"><rb>皆々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-414097-414103">みな</seg><choice source="#source-414103-414109"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-414112-414127"><rb>徐</rb><rt>しず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-414127-414144">かに入る。</seg></p>
